ff time for UPI mandate acceptance is 07:00 PM on last day of IPO bidding. Further bids with confirmed status of mandate amount blocked (RC100) shall be considered as valid applications and hence, investors are advised to submit their UPI applications in IPO well in advance to avoid any last minute technical/systemic constraints that may hamper their ability to participate in IPOs by successfully accepting the mandate.\""},{"title":"Issue Size","value":"\"Initial Public Offer comprising of Fresh Issue of up to 27,00,00,000 equity shares (including Employee Reservation Portion aggregating up to Rs. 5,000 million, Eligible RIL shareholders portion aggregating up to Rs. 25,000 million and Anchor reservation portion of 7,24,74,066 equity shares)\""},{"title":"Issue Type","value":"Book Building"},{"title":"Price Range","value":"Rs. 1065 to Rs. 1119 per Equity Share"},{"title":"Discount","value":"Rs. 54 per equity share to Eligible Employees"},{"title":"Face Value","value":"Rs. 10 per Equity Share"},{"title":"Tick Size","value":"Re. 1"},{"title":"Bid Lot","value":"12 Equity Shares and in multiples thereof"},{"title":"Minimum Order Quantity","value":"12 Equity Shares"},{"title":"Maximum Subscription Amount for Retail Investor","value":"\"Rs. 2,00,000\""},{"title":"Maximum Subscription Amount for Eligible Employee","value":"\"Rs. 5,00,000\""},{"title":"Maximum Subscription Amount for Shareholders","value":"\"Rs. 2,00,000\""},{"title":"Maximum Bid Quantity for QIB Investors","value":"\"17,04,89,712 Equity Shares in the multiples of 12 Equity Shares\""},{"title":"Maximum Bid Quantity for NIB Investors","value":"\"12,14,81,892 Equity Shares in the multiples of 12 Equity Shares\""},{"title":"IPO Market Timings","value":"\"October 21, 2026     9:00 am - 7:00 pm \""},{"title":null,"value":"\"October 22, 2026     9:00 am - 7:00 pm \""},{"title":null,"value":"\"October 23, 2026     9:00 am - 7:00 pm \""},{"title":"Book Running Lead Managers","value":"\"Kotak Mahindra Capital Compan